    <string name="about_content"><b>Beacon SOS</b> is your ultimate personal safety companion, designed to provide immediate assistance when you need it most.\n\n<b>Key Features:</b>\n• 🎙️ <b>Voice &amp; Shake Triggers:</b> Hands-free activation using AI voice recognition or a physical device shake.\n• 🕒 <b>Safety Check-in Timer:</b> Pre-emptive protection that sends alerts automatically if you don\'t check in.\n• 📍 <b>Live Interactive Maps:</b> Real-time location visualization and GPS tracking for precise assistance.\n• ✉️ <b>Trusted Network:</b> Instant SMS notifications to your emergency contacts even without internet.\n• 📜 <b>Emergency History:</b> Interactive logs of all past SOS events and locations.\n\nOur mission is to empower individuals with technology that ensures they are never truly alone in an emergency. Your safety is our highest priority.</string>
